        "exposedClass": "review-required",
        "statement": "Existing and newly written ClusterExternalSecret objects keep working. New writes are stored as v1, while existing objects stay stored as v1beta1 until rewritten, and status.storedVersions keeps listing v1beta1. Nothing fails in this release.",
